error[V2211]: `cert` without `key`
  --> vibranium.config.yaml:10:9
   |
10 |         cert: certs/partner.crt
   |         ^^^^ needs `key`
   = help: a PEM client certificate needs `cert` and `key`: add `key`, or give `pkcs12` instead

error[V2211]: `key` without `cert`
  --> vibranium.config.yaml:12:9
   |
12 |         key: certs/partner.key
   |         ^^^ needs `cert`
   = help: a PEM client certificate needs `cert` and `key`: add `cert`, or give `pkcs12` instead

error[V2211]: `passphrase` without `pkcs12`
  --> vibranium.config.yaml:16:9
   |
16 |         passphrase: •••
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^ needs `pkcs12`
   = help: `passphrase` unlocks a `pkcs12` bundle: add `pkcs12`, or remove `passphrase`

warning[V4013]: `passphrase` is a passphrase written in the config
  --> vibranium.config.yaml:16:9
   |
16 |         passphrase: •••
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^ its value is kept in git with the file
   = help: read it from `.env`: `passphrase: ${secret.NAME}`, with `NAME=` declared in `.env.schema`
